# Daily planning

- Cap: ≤3 must-do, ≤5 applications, ≤3 first outreach, ≤2 follow-ups, 1 prep module.
- Do not exclude roles solely for sponsorship unclear/no.
- Separate facts vs suggestions; cite evidence/confidence for labels.
- Plans are files only until the user executes them.
